<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">File::flush() 方法。当你传入 </span><span style="--shiki-light:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">&amp;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">mut bytes 时，其实是在调用 say_hello::</span></span>
